WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.152
The supplier’s claim does not confirm the appointment The

00:00:04.192 --> 00:00:07.744
supplier says that 09:45 has been approved but the

00:00:07.784 --> 00:00:10.718
approval has not been verified and the slot conflicts

00:00:10.757 --> 00:00:15.007
with two commitments Daniel must keep the appointment pending

00:00:15.349 --> 00:00:18.389
check the claim with the appointed decision-maker and explain

00:00:18.455 --> 00:00:19.257
the conflict
